\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} `many1` guarantees at least one atom, but Lean can\PYGZsq{}t see that, so}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} `atoms.head` would demand a nonemptiness proof. `head!` uses the}
